flowchart TB
accTitle: Layered request-flood defenses
accDescr: Edge capacity and caching reduce origin load, WAF filters HTTP requests, and the ALB distributes allowed work across zones.
I[Internet requests] --> C[CloudFront edge]
C -->|Cache hit| H[Response from edge]
C -->|Origin request| W{WAF rules}
W -->|Blocked or rate limited| X[Stop request]
W -->|Allowed| A[ALB]
A --> E1[EC2 workers AZ A]
A --> E2[EC2 workers AZ B]
M[CloudWatch demand] -.->|Controlled scaling| E1
M -.->|Controlled scaling| E2
class I inputData
class W decision
class X warning
class H,E1,E2 output
